    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 9 · 1:55–1:59 · the sequence</span>
      <strong>Type 3 4 6 1 7 0 5 8</strong>
      Eight keys, in this order: <b>3</b> at 1:54.4, <b>4</b> at 1:55.2, <b>6</b> at 1:55.8, <b>1</b> at 1:56.4, <b>7</b> at 1:57.0, <b>0</b> at 1:58.3, <b>5</b> at 1:58.7, <b>8</b> at 1:59.2. Each key lights up on press and dims again immediately, which is why a one-frame-per-second sampling misses almost all of it — we had to go to 30 frames per second to catch them. The safe pops open right after the 8. Note the shape of it: 346 from the door, 1 and 7 from the paper, 8 from the roll, with 0 and 5 in between.
