      The safe door swings at 2:03 and the interior is <b>empty</b>, with a burst of sparkles coming from inside it. The sparkle is the game's "something was just collected" effect, but no item name appears anywhere on screen in this run, so we cannot tell you what the safe paid out. The two candidates are coins or a second key — and we are not printing either as fact.
