      Back to the white door with the 346 on it. The <b>Key</b> is already in your bag — the inventory at 0:55 shows it selected, and it is picked up while the cabinet is standing open — and it is used on the door at about 2:07. No code, no dial. The recording does not linger: the door gives, the room view comes back, and the video ends on a THANKS FOR WATCHING card at 2:11.
